/**
 * @beta annotation indicates that API is still in development and should be used with caution.
 * For example it's important to not to use beta APIs in the integration tests that are part of the build "greenness"
 * check.
 */
@annotation(noInherit=true)
type Ann.Beta mixes Annotation
